Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 11:22:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 02560/11362] [outer-loop] agent-distance BFS result: agent-ID
 heuristic unlocks sp80 (script already in HEAD via conductor sweep)

Result artifact for the reliable-agent-identification + agent-to-goal-distance heuristic work (the
script landed in HEAD via a conductor git-add-A checkpoint; this commits the results json with
proper attribution). best_first_search with the agent-distance heuristic SOLVES sp80 (4 actions)
where the whole-grid-mismatch heuristic solved nothing; cn04/ar25/ka59 remain 0 at 5000 expansions
(ambiguous agent ID / reflect-config wins / deeper search). identify_agent is a general test-time
method (generalizes to unseen movement games); the target half still needs test-time goal induction.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
